    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·2月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"299\" title=\"2月前瞻.png\" alt=\"2月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241219/f9fd69c35aac31116ff1d9459edbdb3b.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"300\" title=\"2月月小队.png\" alt=\"2月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241219/f3defc992fd03a8b28ac1f48ce797156.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者阿米娅</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">炉中的故事纷纷迎来结局，你会是炉熄之后“阿米娅”想要寻找的事物吗？</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"301\" title=\"2月奖励.png\" alt=\"2月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241219/a9aba253983a583c8a0ff0c8d3154093.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">155</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>2月稀有奖励主题头像“王冠”</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">萨卡兹历史上不可磨灭的符号<span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">。</span></span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
